.SS Abstract
\f[B]OBJECT\f[R] provides \f[B]C\-style object\-oriented
programming\f[R]:
.IP \(bu 2
Object definitions (\f[CR]object\f[R])
.IP \(bu 2
Stack constructors (\f[CR]obj\f[R]) and heap constructors
(\f[CR]new\f[R])
.IP \(bu 2
Bound methods through runtime generated trampolines
.IP \(bu 2
Assembly\-level injection for performance
.IP \(bu 2
Cross\-platform support (16/32/64\-bit Intel) and major compilers
.IP \(bu 2
Memory\-efficient and flexible
